Rust functions from C++:","zh":"您可以从 C++ 调用这些 Rust 函数："}]},{"html_en":"<p>Consider the following C++ header:</p>","sentences":[{"en":"Consider the following C++ header:","zh":"考虑以下 C++ 头文件："}]},{"html_en":"<p>You can call these C++ functions from Rust:</p>","sentences":[{"en":"You can call these C++ functions from Rust:","zh":"您可以从 Rust 调用这些 C++ 函数："}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"getting-started\"><a href=\"#getting-started\">Getting Started</a></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Getting Started","zh":"入门"}]},{"html_en":"<p>We have detailed walkthroughs on how to use C++ from Rust, or Rust from C++,\nusing Crubit, as well as copy-pastable example code. The example code also\nincludes spanshots of what the generated bindings look like.</p>","sentences":[{"en":"We have detailed walkthroughs on how to use C++ from Rust, or Rust from C++, using Crubit, as well as copy-pastable example code.","zh":"我们有关于如何使用 Crubit 从 Rust 使用 C++ 或从 C++ 使用 Rust 的详细演练，以及可复制粘贴的示例代码。"},{"en":"The example code also includes spanshots of what the generated bindings look like.","zh":"示例代码还包括生成的绑定的快照。"}]},{"html_en":"<li>Walkthrough: <a href=\"http://crubit.rs/rust\">C++ Bindings for Rust Libraries</a>\n<ul>\n<li>Examples:\n<a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/tree/main/examples/rust\"><code>examples/rust/</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Walkthrough: C++ Bindings for Rust Libraries Examples: examples/rust/","zh":"演练：Rust 库的 C++ 绑定示例：examples/rust/"}]},{"html_en":"<li>Examples:\n<a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/tree/main/examples/rust\"><code>examples/rust/</code></a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Examples: examples/rust/","zh":"示例：示例/rust/"}]},{"html_en":"<li>Walkthrough: <a href=\"http://crubit.rs/cpp\">Rust Bindings for C++ Libraries</a>\n<ul>\n<li>Examples:\n<a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/tree/main/examples/cpp\"><code>examples/cpp/</code></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>","sentences":[{"en":"Walkthrough: Rust Bindings for C++ Libraries Examples: examples/cpp/","zh":"演练：C++ 库的 Rust 绑定示例：examples/cpp/"}]},{"html_en":"<li>Examples:\n<a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/tree/main/examples/cpp\"><code>examples/cpp/</code></a></li>","sentences":[{"en":"Examples: examples/cpp/","zh":"示例：示例/cpp/"}]},{"html_en":"<h2 id=\"test-matrix\"><a href=\"#test-matrix\">Test Matrix</a></h2>","sentences":[{"en":"Test Matrix","zh":"测试矩阵"}]},{"html_en":"<th>Nightly</th>","sentences":[{"en":"Nightly","zh":"每晚"}]},{"html_en":"<th>Stable</th>","sentences":[{"en":"Stable","zh":"稳定的"}]}],"translated":true,"content_html_zh":"<div class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\">\n    <div id=\"mdbook-help-container\">\n            <h2>键盘快捷键</h2>\n            <div>\n                <p>按 ← 或 → 在章节之间导航</p>\n                <p>按 S 或 / 在书中搜索</p>\n                <p>按 ？ 显示此帮助</p>\n                <p>按 Esc 键隐藏此帮助</p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    <div id=\"mdbook-body-container\">\n        <!-- Work around some values being stored in localStorage wrapped in quotes -->\n        \n\n        <!-- Set the theme before any content is loaded, prevents flash -->\n        \n\n        \n\n        <!-- Hide / unhide sidebar before it is displayed -->\n        \n\n        <nav id=\"mdbook-sidebar\" aria-label=\"Table of contents\">\n            <!-- populated by js -->\n            <mdbook-sidebar-scrollbox></mdbook-sidebar-scrollbox>\n            \n            \n        </nav>\n\n        <div id=\"mdbook-page-wrapper\">\n\n            <div class=\"page\" id=\"mdbook-content\">\n                    <main>\n                        <!-- text located in README.md for GitHub and basic source viewing. -->\n<h2 id=\"crubit-crust-bidirectional-interop-tool\">Crubit：C++/Rust 双向互操作工具</h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/rust.yml\"><img src=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/rust.yml/badge.svg\" alt=\"rust workflow\"></a>\n<a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/github-google%2Fcrubit-blue?logo=github\" alt=\"GitHub\"></a></p>\n<p>Crubit 是 C++ 和 Rust 的双向绑定生成器，目标是集成 C++ 和 Rust 生态系统。</p>\n<h2 id=\"status\">地位</h2>\n<p>请参阅状态页面以了解当前支持的功能的概述。</p>\n<h2 id=\"example\">例子</h2>\n<div>\n<nav>\n\n\n</nav>\n<div data-tabname=\"Calling Rust from C++\">\n<p>考虑以下 Rust 库：</p>\n<pre><code><span>#![allow(unused)]\n</span><span>fn main() {\n</span>pub struct Account {\n    pub id: u64,\n    pub balance: f64,\n}\n\nimpl std::fmt::Display for Account { ... }\n\n// Takes shared references, mapped to const references in C++.\npub fn calculate_interest(account: &amp;Account, rate: f64) -&gt; f64 { ... }\n\n// Takes a string slice, mapped to rs_std::StrRef in C++.\npub fn is_valid_username(username: &amp;str) -&gt; bool { ... }\n<span>}</span></code></pre>\n<p>您可以从 C++ 调用这些 Rust 函数：</p>\n<pre><code>#include \"path/to/account.h\"\n#include &lt;iostream&gt;\n\nvoid demo() {\n  account::Account my_account{.id = 123, .balance = 1000.0};\n  double interest = account::calculate_interest(my_account, 0.05);\n\n  // my_account is printable because Account implements Display in Rust!\n  std::cout &lt;&lt; my_account &lt;&lt; std::endl;\n\n  if (account::is_valid_username(\"bob\")) {\n    std::cout &lt;&lt; \"Valid user\" &lt;&lt; std::endl;\n  }\n}\n</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n<div data-tabname=\"Calling C++ from Rust\">\n<p>考虑以下 C++ 头文件：</p>\n<pre><code>#include &lt;string_view&gt;\n#include &lt;optional&gt;\n#include &lt;memory&gt;\n\nstruct User {\n  int id;\n  double balance;\n};\n\nstd::optional&lt;User&gt; FindUser(int id);\nstd::unique_ptr&lt;User&gt; CreateUser(std::string_view name, int id);\n</code></pre>\n<p>您可以从 Rust 调用这些 C++ 函数：</p>\n<pre><code>use cc_std::std::unique_ptr;\nuse ffi_11::{c_double, c_int};\nuse user_api::{CreateUser, FindUser, User};\n\nlet id: c_int = 123;\nlet user: Option&lt;User&gt; = FindUser(id);\nif let Some(u) = user {\n    let balance: c_double = u.balance;\n    println!(\"User {} has balance {}\", u.id, balance);\n}\n\nlet new_user: unique_ptr&lt;User&gt; = CreateUser(\"Alice\".into(), 456);\n</code></pre>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\n<h2 id=\"getting-started\">入门</h2>\n<p>我们有关于如何使用 Crubit 从 Rust 使用 C++ 或从 C++ 使用 Rust 的详细演练，以及可复制粘贴的示例代码。 示例代码还包括生成的绑定的快照。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>演练：Rust 库的 C++ 绑定示例：examples/rust/</li>\n<li>演练：C++ 库的 Rust 绑定示例：examples/cpp/</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"test-matrix\">测试矩阵</h2>\n<div>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr><th>每晚</th><th>稳定的</th></tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/nightly-0.json\" alt=\"nightly-0\"></a></td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/stable-0.json\" alt=\"stable-0\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/nightly-1.json\" alt=\"nightly-1\"></a></td><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/stable-1.json\" alt=\"stable-1\"></a></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/nightly-2.json\" alt=\"nightly-2\"></a></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/nightly-3.json\" alt=\"nightly-3\"></a></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/nightly-4.json\" alt=\"nightly-4\"></a></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/nightly-5.json\" alt=\"nightly-5\"></a></td><td></td></tr>\n<tr><td><a href=\"https://github.com/google/crubit/actions/workflows/nightly.yaml\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint?url=https://raw.githubusercontent.com/google/crubit/test-matrix/nightly-6.json\" alt=\"nightly-6\"></a></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n\n                    </main>\n\n                    <nav aria-label=\"Page navigation\">\n                        <!-- Mobile navigation buttons -->\n\n                            <a rel=\"next prefetch\" href=\"overview/status.html\" title=\"Next chapter\" aria-label=\"Next chapter\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"Right\">\n                                <span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Free 6.2.0 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.com/license/free (Icons: CC BY 4.0, Fonts: SIL OFL 1.1, Code: MIT License) Copyright 2022 Fonticons, Inc. --><path d=\"M278.6 233.4c12.5 12.5 12.5 32.8 0 45.3l-160 160c-12.5 12.5-32.8 12.5-45.3 0s-12.5-32.8 0-45.3L210.7 256 73.4 118.6c-12.5-12.5-12.5-32.8 0-45.3s32.8-12.5 45.3 0l160 160z\" /></svg></span>\n                            </a>\n\n                        \n                    </nav>\n                </div>\n\n            <nav aria-label=\"Page navigation\">\n\n                    <a rel=\"next prefetch\" href=\"overview/status.html\" title=\"Next chapter\" aria-label=\"Next chapter\" aria-keyshortcuts=\"Right\">\n                        <span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 320 512\"><!--! Font Awesome Free 6.2.0 by @fontawesome - https://fontawesome.com License - https://fontawesome.